{"title": "SlashCollect", "link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50557273", "summary": "<p>Hey folks!<p>Varsha here, managing SEO at SlashCollect<p>slashcollect is an ai-powered payments collection platform - we built it specifically with Indian businesses in mind - especially educational institutes, lenders, & businesses that are constantly juggling instalments.<p>I feel that a lot of horizontal payment companies are there in Indian market but we need more vertical focused soltuons.<p>For example: a very well designed checkout and collection flow for Indian ed-techs maybe?<p>I'd love to hear from people who have seen products or approaches that make recurring collections a whole lot smoother.<p>Fintech, payments & SaaS folk - want to hear from you.<p>thanks!!</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50557273\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50557273</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 0</p>", "published": "2026-11-19T08:01:05+00:00", "source": "Hacker News Best", "category": "techblog", "matched_entities": {}, "ontology": {"repo": "BlogRadar", "category": "techblog", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "source_event_model": "blog_post", "event_model_id": "tech.blog_post", "evidence_policy_ids": ["source_metadata", "article_text"], "event_model_payload": {"headline": "SlashCollect", "source_name": "Hacker News Best", "source_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50557273", "published_at": "2026-11-19T08:01:05+00:00", "summary": "<p>Hey folks!<p>Varsha here, managing SEO at SlashCollect<p>slashcollect is an ai-powered payments collection platform - we built it specifically with Indian businesses in mind - especially educational institutes, lenders, & businesses that are constantly juggling instalments.<p>I feel that a lot of horizontal payment companies are there in Indian market but we need more vertical focused soltuons.<p>For example: a very well designed checkout and collection flow for Indian ed-techs maybe?<p>I'd love to hear from people who have seen products or approaches that make recurring collections a whole lot smoother.<p>Fintech, payments & SaaS folk - want to hear from you.<p>thanks!!</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50557273\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50557273</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 0</p>"}}, "logged_at": "2026-11-19T08:26:00.243833+00:00"}
